WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.687
RCMP MAID: The Dereliction of Duty.

00:00:03.637 --> 00:00:09.450
60,167 Canadians are dead under state-sanctioned killing.

00:00:09.450 --> 00:00:22.762
Three RCMP Commissioners swore an oath to uphold the law — and every last one of them stood down while their country built a bureaucratic extermination programme that would make the architects of Aktion T4 blush at its efficiency.
